{"version":1,"content":"<p>Anthropic PBC尋求在首次公開募股（IPO）中實現約1.4萬億美元的完全攤薄估值，力爭成為首家上市的前沿人工智能實驗室。這家Claude聊天機械人開發商及其聯合創始人尋求通過IPO和私募配售籌集至多904億美元。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585840.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T21:27:23.064986+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T21:10:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T21:20:40.290447+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T21:20:40.290447+00:00","content_hash":"018475c2cdd49219d88c8f37b826a9acbc2080e25b73de4e57a24985ede6082b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}